<ArticleLayout
    title={title}
    description={description}
    author={author}
    authorUrl={authorUrl}
    pubDate={pubDate}
    readingTime={readingTime}
    image={image}
    imageAlt={imageAlt}
    category="Accessories"
    categorySlug="gear"
    headings={headings}
>
  <!-- Introduction -->
  <h2 id="introduction">Power Up Anywhere in the World</h2>
  <p>
    Different countries use different electrical outlets—and discovering your charger doesn't fit when you need
    to work is a frustrating start to any trip. A universal travel adapter is essential gear for international
    digital nomads.
  </p>
  <p>
    We tested 8 travel adapters across four continents, evaluating compatibility, build quality, USB charging
    capabilities, and safety certifications.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Quick answer:</strong> The <a href="#epicka">Epicka Universal Adapter</a> is our top pick—$25, works
    in 150+ countries, has 5 USB ports, and handles high-wattage devices. For Apple users who need fast USB-C
    charging, the <a href="#satechi-75w">Satechi 75W Travel Charger</a> is worth the upgrade.
  </p>

  <!-- Quick Picks -->
  <h2 id="quick-picks">Our Top 3 Travel Adapter Picks</h2>
  <p>Short on time? Here are our top recommendations:</p>
  <ComparisonTable
      columns={quickPicksColumns}
      rows={quickPicksRows}
      caption="Top 3 travel adapters for digital nomads"
  />

  <!-- Understanding Plug Types -->
  <h2 id="plug-types">Understanding Plug Types</h2>
  <p>
    There are 15+ plug types worldwide. The most common:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Type A/B:</strong> United States, Canada, Mexico, Japan (flat parallel pins)</li>
    <li><strong>Type C:</strong> Europe, most of Asia, South America (two round pins)</li>
    <li><strong>Type G:</strong> United Kingdom, Ireland, Singapore (three rectangular)</li>
    <li><strong>Type I:</strong> Australia, New Zealand, China (angled flat pins)</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    A universal adapter covers all major types. The adapters in our list work in 150-200+ countries.
  </p>

  <!-- Detailed Reviews -->
  <h2 id="detailed-reviews">Travel Adapter Detailed Reviews</h2>

