    certifications.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Key specifications:</strong>
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> 150+ countries (Type A/B/C/G/I)</li>
    <li><strong>USB Ports:</strong> 4× USB-A (2.4A each), 1× USB-C (3A)</li>
    <li><strong>AC Rating:</strong> 1840W max (100-250V)</li>
    <li><strong>Safety:</strong> CE/FCC certified, built-in fuse</li>
    <li><strong>Weight:</strong> 5.6 oz</li>
    <li><strong>Includes:</strong> Travel pouch</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    <strong>Pros:</strong>
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>5 USB ports for multi-device charging</li>
    <li>Works in 150+ countries</li>
    <li>$25 is excellent value</li>
    <li>Handles high-wattage devices (1840W)</li>
